ustom","cefr":"B1","use_role":"P","example":"The guide explained a local custom: visitors are asked to take off their shoes before they go inside.","card":"New","sort_order":2},{"id":"W4-CO-3","week_number":4,"group_kind":"core","target":"destination","cefr":"B1","use_role":"P","example":"It''s one of the most popular holiday destinations on the coast.","card":"New","sort_order":3},{"id":"W4-CO-4","week_number":4,"group_kind":"core","target":"set off","cefr":"B2","use_role":"B","example":"We set off early to avoid the heavy traffic.","card":"New","sort_order":4},{"id":"W4-CO-5","week_number":4,"group_kind":"core","target":"get around","cefr":"B1*","use_role":"P","example":"We were given a map to help us get around the city.","card":"New","sort_order":5},{"id":"W4-CO-6","week_number":4,"group_kind":"core","target":"unfamiliar","cefr":"B2","use_role":"B","example":"We were unfamiliar with the ticket system.","card":"New","sort_order":6},{"id":"W4-CO-7","week_number":4,"group_kind":"core","target":"welcoming","cefr":"B2*","use_role":"B","example":"The hotel where we stayed had a welcoming atmosphere.","card":"New","sort_order":7},{"id":"W4-CO-8","week_number":4,"group_kind":"core","target":"local","cefr":"B1","use_role":"P","example":"Local food is served in the hotel restaurant.","card":"New","sort_order":8},{"id":"W4-CO-9","week_number":4,"group_kind":"collocation","target":"take a guided tour","cefr":null,"use_role":null,"example":"We took a guided tour of the old town.","card":"New","sort_order":9},{"id":"W4-CO-10","week_number":4,"group_kind":"collocation","target":"try the local food","cefr":null,"use_role":null,"example":"We were encouraged to try the local food.","card":"New","sort_order":10},{"id":"W4-CO-11","week_number":4,"group_kind":"collocation","target":"travel light","cefr":null,"use_role":null,"example":"We travelled light because there wasn''t much room for luggage.","card":"New","sort_order":11},{"id":"W4-CO-12","week_number":4,"group_kind":"collocation","target":"stop overnight","cefr":null,"use_role":null,"example":"We stopped overnight in York before driving on.","card":"New","sort_order":12},{"id":"W4-CO-13","week_number":4,"group_kind":"collocation","target":"miss a connection","cefr":null,"use_role":null,"example":"Our flight was delayed, so we missed our connection.","card":"New","sort_order":13},{"id":"W4-FA-14","week_number":4,"group_kind":"family","target":"culture","cefr":null,"use_role":null,"example":"culture, cultural, culturally","card":"Shared / recognition","sort_order":14},{"id":"W4-FA-15","week_number":4,"group_kind":"family","target":"tradition","cefr":null,"use_role":null,"example":"traditional, traditionally","card":"Shared / recognition","sort_order":15},{"id":"W4-FA-16","week_number":4,"group_kind":"family","target":"tourism","cefr":null,"use_role":null,"example":"tourism, touristy","card":"Shared / recognition","sort_order":16},{"id":"W4-OP-17","week_number":4,"group_kind":"optional","target":"break your journey","cefr":null,"use_role":null,"example":"We broke our journey with an overnight stay in York. Mainly BrE.","card":"Recognition only","sort_order":17},{"id":"W4-LI-18","week_number":4,"group_kind":"linker","target":"to begin with","cefr":"B1","use_role":null,"example":"To begin with, we were shown around the old town. (sequence, writing task)","card":"New","sort_order":18},{"id":"W4-LI-19","week_number":4,"group_kind":"linker","target":"what''s more","cefr":"B2","use_role":null,"example":"The hotel was comfortable. What''s more, breakfast was included. (addition, writing task)","card":"New","sort_order":19},{"id":"W4-LI-20","week_number":4,"group_kind":"linker","target":"despite","cefr":"B1","use_role":null,"example":"Despite the rain, the outdoor tour went ahead. (concession, writing task)","card":"New","sort_order":20},{"id":"W4-LI-21","week_number":4,"group_kind":"linker","target":"all in all","cefr":"B2*","use_role":null,"example":"All in all, we had an excellent trip. (summary, writing task)","card":"New","sort_order":21}]'::jsonb) as v(
